  "info": [
    {
      "name": "DAtuviSezaH",
      "value": "kezucana  DAtupAWezu asya DAtoH OpadeSikasvarUpam 'gadI' iti dIrGa-IkArAntaM nirdizwaM dfSyate . tatra ikAraH kevalam uccAraRArTaH eva sTApitaH jYeyaH, na hi itsaMjYakaH ."
